        "beatLine": "You actually came. I had a bet with myself about that.|She had a bet with me. I said you would.|She said you would not, so one of us is out a coffee.|It has been a long week. I did not think anyone was coming.|So. Settle it. Were we worth the trip?|He asks everyone that. He is not as casual about it as he sounds.|I am standing right here.|You are. And you are still waiting on an answer from me.|That went about how I expected.|It did not, and you know it.",
        "beatChoice": "||||0|||1||",
