        "choiceText": "Worth the trip.;Ask me at the end of the night.;You made a bet about me.|I am not in a hurry.;What is the question again?;You two rehearse this?",
        "choiceTags": "warm;neutral;cool|warm;neutral;tease",
        "choiceReply": "Then I am out a coffee and I do not mind at all.;Fair. I will hold you to it.;I did. That was probably not the introduction I wanted.|No. You are not. That is unusual and I notice it.;There was not one. That was the point.;Every Thursday. He does my half better than I do.",
